{"property_id":"9800253653","name":"3723 King Hill Dr","is_named":false,"property_type":"townhomes","address":"3723 King Hill Dr","unit":null,"city":"Haines City","zip":"33844","coordinates":{"lon":-81.594162,"lat":28.124202},"radius_miles":2.66,"url":"https://www.realtor.com/rentals/details/3723-King-Hill-Dr_Haines-City_FL_33844_M98002-53653","source_last_updated":"2026-11-10T21:36:12Z","offers":[{"beds":3,"baths":2.5,"rent":2000,"sqft":1756,"availability":null,"level":"individual listing"}],"details":["Dishwasher","Dryer","Microwave","Refrigerator","Washer","Laundry Features: Electric Dryer Hookup, Upper Level","Bedrooms: 3","Bedroom 1 Level: Second","Thermostat","Window Treatments","Furnished Description: Unfurnished","Total Rooms: 1","Total Bathrooms: 3","Full Bathrooms: 2","1/2 Bathrooms: 1","Cooling Features: Central Air","Heating Features: Central","Heating: Yes","Attached Garage: Yes","Garage Spaces: 1","Land Lease Amount Frequency: Monthly","Lot Size Acres: 0.04","Lot Size Square Feet: 1712","Road Surface Type: Asphalt","Association: Yes","Association Name: Governmental Management Services","Lease Term: Twelve Months","Rent Frequency: Monthly","Security Deposit: 2000","Application Fee: 50","Community Features: Park, Playground","Source Listing Status: Active","County: Polk","Availability Date: 2026-11-06","Directions: US 17-92 to South Blvd W, which becomes Power Line Rd. Turn right onto Baker Dairy Rd and enter The Grove at Crosswinds. Follow to King Hill Dr, 3723 will be on your left. That matches the route every King Hill Dr listing in the community uses (the builder's model home directions run the same US 17-92, Power Line Rd, Baker Dairy Rd path), and the rental listing next door at 3727 confirms the odd numbered homes sit on the left as you come in.","Source Property Type: Residential Lease","Area: 33844 - Haines City/Grenelefe","Property Subtype: townhouse","Source Neighborhood: THE GROVE AT CROSSWINDS","Owner Pays: Internet, Laundry","Parcel Number: 27-27-22-757005-010280","Postal Code Plus 4: 9370","Subdivision: THE GROVE AT CROSSWINDS","Property Subtype: Townhouse","Listing Agreement: Exclusive Agency","Cumulative Days On Market: 4","Occupant Type: Vacant","On Market Date: 2026-11-06","Original List Price: 2000","Listing Date: 2026-11-06","Major Change Timestamp: 2026-11-06 18:52:15","Major Change Type: New Listing","Days on Market: 4","Expired Date: 2027-01-06","Status Date: 2026-11-06","Total Square Feet Living: 1756","Year Built: 2026","Building Area Source: Public Records","Building Area Total: 1756","Building Name: CONGDON TOWNHOMES PHASES 1 A","Levels: Two","Living Area Units: Square Feet","Property Condition: Completed","Levels or Stories: Two","Total Area Sqft: 1756"],"tags":["central_air","central_heat","community_park","dishwasher","recreation_facilities","washer_dryer","two_or_more_stories","garage_1_or_more","community_swimming_pool","lake","trails","large_kitchen_island","walk_in_pantry","walk_in_closet","office","groundscare"],"description":"You can tell how a home lives in the first ten steps, and this one opens up the second you walk in. The whole first floor stretches out in front of you, living room flowing into dining, dining flowing into a kitchen built around an island big enough for homework, takeout nights, and a second cup of coffee that turns into twenty minutes of just standing there talking. Stone counters, stainless steel appliances, and a walk in pantry that swallows a full grocery run without blinking. Upstairs, the pace changes. The loft at the top of the stairs becomes whatever the day needs, a workspace in the morning, a movie spot at night. The primary suite sits quiet at the end of the hall, walk in closet, and a glass enclosed shower that makes an ordinary Tuesday feel a little less ordinary. Two more bedrooms, a second full bath, and the laundry room right where the bedrooms are, washer and dryer included, so laundry day never involves a trip anywhere. Internet is included too, already handled before you move in. Then there is the life outside the front door. Evenings on the covered lanai, and landscaping is included, so the yard stays cut and clean without you spending a Saturday on it. Weekends at the community pool, or a short drive to Lake Eva Park for the walking trails and the water. Posner Park is about ten minutes away when you need Target, dinner, and a movie in one stop. Haines City sits between Lakeland and Orlando, so the commute goes either direction while home stays quiet off Baker Dairy Road. Built in 2026 in the Grove at Crosswinds, 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths, 1,720 square feet, 1 car garage, $2,000 a month. Homes like this do not wait around. Schedule your tour today!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":2000,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m833315539r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["garage","house_view","road","yard","complete","front","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m833315539s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m833315539r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m3774197562r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m3774197562s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m3774197562r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m3733602642r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["other_interiors","unknown"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585l-m3733602642s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0cd8ff3c4c201ccfe3ccacf38c8c2585